        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electronic component, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electronic component, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all components on a desktop motherboard, a laptop mainboard and a CRT TV board. In 2023, no major updates are implemented for this dataset, except for the use of updated ICT datasets in the background/inventory, e.g. capacitors, inductors, resistors, etc.; UUID: 5e87fea2-83fc-30d7-bb96-0782c3d685ac
This dataset covers material input (and within this the respective production efforts) for unspecified electronic components.
Location: Data represent a global valuable average composition of active and passive electronic components.
Technology: see general comments
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e87fea2-83fc-30d7-bb96-0782c3d685ac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
